{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ReThink | Evolved Free is a free first person puzzle game in a peaceful futuristic setting, that features a variety of Puzzles that utilize Lasers and the behavior of light and it's colors to create challenging problems to solve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use proven gameplay mechanics to puzzle your way through the game's beautiful world, which is now filled with even more puzzles than in previous games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ReThink | Evolved Free features more than 50 Puzzles that make use of newly introduced features and old ones alike, to keep the gears in your head turning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All puzzles follow the same set of rules, but often come with a twist that will make you think about your solution, and often rethink it.\u00a0 <br> <br><strong>The game is free, just go and try it out - no strings attached.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improvements over ReThink | Evolved 6:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Improvements to decorations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Improved pathing and level layout</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081880?t=1761062443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081880/3bd4ca7ee0a1e0d1344105defe00a3199eeef6b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761062443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081880/f2ce62f4ccd24ef387a3a50c7f1a284bf1bf34a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761062443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081880/f2ce62f4ccd24ef387a3a50c7f1a284bf1bf34a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761062443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2